@1025 = ~Gross Wine~
@1026 = ~Gross Wine

A bottle of supposedly traditional honey wine, prepared from an old family recipe. The murky liquid smells strangely sour, and its bitter, unpleasant flavour suggests the maker followed the recipe rather poorly. Despite its dreadful taste, the wine is harmless.~
@1027 = ~A bottle of strangely murky wine with a sour smell and an unpleasant, bitter flavour. It appears harmless, if barely drinkable.~
